- SKIP 3590f588202 (update draw/read buffers on drawable switch): superseded — shadow dlls/opengl32/unix_wgl.c pop_default_fbo_buffers (line 614) syncs per-context draw_buffers[]/read_buffer via wrap_glDrawBuffer(s)/wrap_glReadBuffer (newer form of the same intent); has_been_current seeding 0 refs in shadow, and the win32u NamedFramebufferDrawBuffer ATTACHMENT1 hunk has no anchor (no NamedFramebuffer*Buffer calls left in shadow opengl.c).
- SKIP f23f4e2c664 (sampling path for multisampled drawables): absorbed — shadow dlls/win32u/opengl.c:1114 `if (drawable->read_fbo == drawable->draw_fbo && use_default_gamma_ramp())` direct-blits, else takes the sampling/shader path; exactly the post-image condition (`read_fbo == draw_fbo && !needs_gamma`).
- SKIP bced045a905 (swap draw buffers in framebuffer_surface_swap): absorbed — shadow opengl.c:1249-1252 swaps draw_fbo COLOR_ATTACHMENT0/1 renderbuffers (plus stereo 2/3), exceeding the commit.
