- SKIP 2e5709e1432 (handle framebuffer drawable in pop_internal_context): superseded — pop_internal_context 0 refs in shadow; both make-current paths (opengl.c:785 make_client_context_current, :2769 context_sync_drawables) resolve framebuffer drawables via get_target() before driver p_context_activate — same intent, newer form.
