- SKIP d0baa688265 (current front texture when blitting with gamma): absorbed — shadow blit queries the live attachment (opengl.c:1134 p_glGetFramebufferAttachmentParameteriv READ_FRAMEBUFFER/ATTACHMENT0 -> front) and struct framebuffer_surface has no `frame` counter left to remove.
